Kreobuddha UI bundles third-party font software.

Inter
  Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter).
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

  The font files are published in this package under `dist/assets/fonts`, together with the full
  licence text: `LICENSE-inter.txt`.

  The variable font is included, covering the whole 100–900 weight range, split into a Latin and a
  Cyrillic subset. The files are taken unmodified from the @fontsource-variable distribution of
  Inter.

  No monospace family is bundled. Inter carries tabular figures, which is what aligned numerals
  actually require.

